    "body": "Allow GeoNoders to be able to turn on and customize the \"Cookies & Privacy\" warnings as required by the current laws on privacy.\r\n\r\nIn the \"custom theme\" section, extend the model in order to include the cookies & privacy settings\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1278021/57156885-6cae2f00-6ddf-11e9-8c33-fc67915b3de5.png)\r\n...\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1278021/57156893-759f0080-6ddf-11e9-8280-ef187d1e10bf.png)\r\n\r\nOnce enabled, the outcome will be something like this:\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1278021/57156916-8cddee00-6ddf-11e9-9f20-3da4b0e118b3.png)\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1278021/57156928-96675600-6ddf-11e9-9f6c-0e97c9bdfeae.png)\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1278021/57156942-a121eb00-6ddf-11e9-9d9d-e73c596d0b2b.png)\r\n\r\n\r\n",
